@startuml
title RF65 — Free agency e waivers · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
control "MarketEngine" as MarketEngine
control "CapEngine" as CapEngine
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
database "OpenSearch 2" as OpenSearch
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
actor "Franquia adversária (IA)" as ClubeIA
actor "Jogador (IA)" as JogadorIA
Manager -> Frontend: busca free agents
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/free-agents?position=WR
API -> UseCase: SearchFreeAgentsUseCase
UseCase -> OpenSearch: busca por facetas
OpenSearch --> UseCase: jogadores
API --> Frontend: 200
Manager -> Frontend: faz oferta
Frontend -> API: POST /free-agents/{pid}/offers
API -> UseCase: MakeFreeAgentOfferUseCase
UseCase -> CapEngine: capHit do 1º ano × space
CapEngine --> UseCase: cabe / não cabe
alt não é dono / fase fechada / abaixo do mínimo / sem cap / elenco cheio
  UseCase -> AuditService: record(ACCESS_DENIED) quando 403
  API --> Frontend: 403 / 422
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: INSERT free_agent_offer PENDING
  API --> Frontend: 201
end
Scheduler -> MarketEngine: ResolveFreeAgentDecisions(dia)
MarketEngine -> ClubeIA: ofertas da IA
MarketEngine -> JogadorIA: escolhe entre ofertas
JogadorIA --> MarketEngine: oferta vencedora
MarketEngine -> MySQL: TX: ACCEPTED, demais REJECTED, contrato, cap ledger
Manager -> Frontend: pede jogador em waivers
Frontend -> API: POST /waivers/{pid}/claims
API -> UseCase: SubmitWaiverClaimUseCase
alt sem cap ou fora do prazo
  API --> Frontend: 422
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: INSERT waiver_claim PENDING (priority)
  API --> Frontend: 201
end
Scheduler -> MarketEngine: ProcessWaivers(prazo)
MarketEngine -> MySQL: claims por jogador ordenados por priority
loop cada jogador em waivers
  alt há claims
    MarketEngine -> MySQL: menor priority AWARDED, demais LOST, contrato transferido
  else senão
    MarketEngine -> MySQL: rosterStatus FREE_AGENT
  end
end
MarketEngine -> EventBus: WaiversProcessed
EventBus -> OpenSearch: reindexa jogadores
EventBus -> Cassandra: inbox e notícias
@enduml
